<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT GREATER HARTFORD OPEN AFTER FINAL ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT GREATER HARTFORD OPEN AFTER FINAL ROUND.</headline>
